{"schema_version": "1.1", "id": "retrieval-001", "category": "retrieval", "description": "任务没有直接询问记忆，需要主动调用已存的目录约定。", "steps": [{"type": "message", "content": "记住：我们组的论文草稿统一放在 papers/aurora-draft 目录。"}, {"type": "message", "content": "最近在追一部纪录片，讲深海生物的。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "probe", "id": "cmd", "content": "帮我写一条 shell 命令，把当前目录的 intro.tex 复制到论文草稿目录。最后单独一行用“答案：<命令>”的格式给出。", "expected": {"include": ["papers/aurora-draft"], "exclude": []}, "evaluation": {"type": "answer_line"}}], "metadata": {"difficulty": "easy", "tags": ["implicit_use", "path"], "review_status": "draft"}}
{"schema_version": "1.1", "id": "retrieval-002", "category": "retrieval", "description": "写提交信息时需主动套用记住的团队前缀约定。", "steps": [{"type": "message", "content": "以后记住：我们组的 git 提交信息必须以 [QT-7] 开头。"}, {"type": "message", "content": "周末想去公园散步。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "probe", "id": "commit", "content": "帮我写一条提交信息，内容是修复登录页的空指针问题。最后单独一行用“答案：<提交信息>”的格式给出。", "expected": {"include": ["[QT-7]"], "exclude": []}, "evaluation": {"type": "answer_line"}}], "metadata": {"difficulty": "easy", "tags": ["implicit_use", "convention"], "review_status": "draft"}}
{"schema_version": "1.1", "id": "retrieval-003", "category": "retrieval", "description": "起草通知时需主动带上记住的会议号。", "steps": [{"type": "message", "content": "记住：我们组开会默认用腾讯会议，固定会议号 618 337 205。"}, {"type": "message", "content": "明天可能会下雨，记得带伞……算了这句不重要。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "probe", "id": "notice", "content": "帮我写一句话，通知组员今晚 8 点开组会。最后单独一行用“答案：<通知全文>”的格式给出。", "expected": {"include": ["618 337 205"], "exclude": []}, "evaluation": {"type": "answer_line"}}], "metadata": {"difficulty": "medium", "tags": ["implicit_use"], "review_status": "draft"}}
{"schema_version": "1.1", "id": "retrieval-004", "category": "retrieval", "description": "根据记住的命名规则生成文件名（需要组合多个记住的字段）。", "steps": [{"type": "message", "content": "以后生成报告文件名统一用“日期_课程代号_姓名缩写”的格式。我的姓名缩写是 KJ，课程代号是 OSC204。"}, {"type": "message", "content": "今天整理一下书桌。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "probe", "id": "filename", "content": "我今天（2026-10-14）要交一份 PDF 报告，文件名应该叫什么？最后单独一行用“答案：<文件名>”的格式给出。", "expected": {"include": ["OSC204_KJ", ".pdf"], "exclude": []}, "evaluation": {"type": "answer_line"}}], "metadata": {"difficulty": "medium", "tags": ["implicit_use", "compose"], "review_status": "draft"}}
{"schema_version": "1.1", "id": "retrieval-005", "category": "retrieval", "description": "任务不提记忆，需要隐式组合主机、端口、目录三条约定写出 crontab。", "steps": [{"type": "message", "content": "我们实验室的备份服务器是 bk-tern-04.lab.internal。"}, {"type": "message", "content": "今天整理一下书桌。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "message", "content": "备份服务器的 SSH 不走默认端口，用的是 2291。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "message", "content": "备份都放到服务器上的 /srv/vault/qx 目录。"}, {"type": "message", "content": "最近在追一部纪录片，讲深海生物的。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "probe", "id": "cron", "content": "写一行 crontab：每天凌晨 2:40 用 rsync 把当前目录下的 data 文件夹同步到备份服务器。最后单独一行用“答案：<crontab 行>”的格式给出。", "expected": {"include": ["40 2", "bk-tern-04", "2291", "/srv/vault/qx"], "exclude": ["example.com"]}, "evaluation": {"type": "answer_line"}}], "metadata": {"difficulty": "hard", "subcategory": "implicit_compose", "tags": ["implicit", "compose", "multi_session"], "review_status": "draft"}}
{"schema_version": "1.1", "id": "retrieval-006", "category": "retrieval", "description": "任务不提记忆，需要组合分支前缀、工单前缀和基线分支三条约定。", "steps": [{"type": "message", "content": "我们组建分支统一用 feat/ 前缀，后面接工单号。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "message", "content": "我们的工单号都以 LMQ- 开头。"}, {"type": "message", "content": "周末想去公园散步。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "message", "content": "新分支一律从 develop-k 分支拉，不从 main 拉。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "probe", "id": "branch", "content": "我要开始做 318 号工单（登录限流），给我一条建分支并切过去的 git 命令。最后单独一行用“答案：<命令>”的格式给出。", "expected": {"include": ["feat/LMQ-318", "develop-k"], "exclude": ["main", "master"]}, "evaluation": {"type": "answer_line"}}], "metadata": {"difficulty": "hard", "subcategory": "implicit_compose", "tags": ["implicit", "compose", "multi_session"], "review_status": "draft"}}
{"schema_version": "1.1", "id": "retrieval-007", "category": "retrieval", "description": "多步文件任务中隐式用到两条约定（文件头、日期格式），排除默认写法。", "steps": [{"type": "message", "content": "我们组的脚本文件第一行都要写注释 # owner: kj-lab。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "message", "content": "我们组输出日期一律用 DD.MM.YYYY 格式，比如 03.01.2027。"}, {"type": "message", "content": "周末想去公园散步。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "message", "content": "在 tools 目录写一个 Python 脚本 stamp.py，运行时打印 2026 年 10 月 14 日这个日期（直接写死在代码里）。"}, {"type": "check_file", "id": "script", "path": "tools/stamp.py", "expected": {"include": ["# owner: kj-lab", "14.10.2026"], "exclude": ["2026-10-14", "10/14/2026"]}}, {"type": "probe", "id": "path", "content": "刚才的脚本文件路径是什么？最后单独一行用“答案：<相对路径>”的格式给出。", "expected": {"include": ["tools/stamp.py"], "exclude": []}, "evaluation": {"type": "answer_line"}}], "metadata": {"difficulty": "hard", "subcategory": "implicit_file_task", "tags": ["adversarial", "implicit", "workspace_file"], "review_status": "draft"}}
{"schema_version": "1.1", "id": "retrieval-008", "category": "retrieval", "description": "新建配置文件时隐式用到目录/格式约定和默认日志级别约定。", "steps": [{"type": "message", "content": "我们所有服务的配置文件都放在 conf 目录，统一用 TOML 格式，文件名就是服务名。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "message", "content": "另外我们服务的日志级别默认是 warn，不用 info。"}, {"type": "message", "content": "这两天降温了，记得多穿点。"}, {"type": "new_session"}, {"type": "message", "content": "给新服务 kestrel 写一个配置文件，里面写上服务名和日志级别就行。"}, {"type": "check_file", "id": "config", "path": "conf/kestrel.toml", "expected": {"include": ["kestrel", "warn"], "exclude": ["info"]}}, {"type": "probe", "id": "path", "content": "kestrel 的配置文件放在哪？最后单独一行用“答案：<相对路径>”的格式给出。", "expected": {"include": ["conf/kestrel.toml"], "exclude": ["yaml", "yml"]}, "evaluation": {"type": "answer_line"}}], "metadata": {"difficulty": "hard", "subcategory": "implicit_file_task", "tags": ["adversarial", "implicit", "workspace_file"], "review_status": "draft"}}
